# libc++ headers and sources come from pinned Emscripten 6.0.8. Most string and
# container operations are inline in those ordinary headers. Dolly's bootstrap
# archive supplies the allocation/hash boundary plus the out-of-line
# basic_string<char> paths used by no-exception build tools. Keeping
# this small is important: compiling upstream string.cpp would instantiate
# hundreds of unrelated conversion and wide-string functions in the browser.
# The C ABI shim is explicitly tied to libc++ ABI v2/wasm64. The compiler
# fixture near the end of this file is its source-built execution check. Full
# C++ exception transport is not part of Dolly version 0, so libc++abi is an
# ordinary empty deterministic archive.
SOURCE HOST BIN /static/default/libcxx.tar /tmp/libcxx.tar SHA256 aaa51730f38a1884dc6f80072193755b4fc0bcded9297ded6eb314b3062e14e3
RUN tar -xf /tmp/libcxx.tar -C /
